        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Add non-mutating Claws validation lifecycle",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nAdds the complete non-mutating **Claws** validation slice in one PR:\n\n- `openclaw.claw.v1` manifest schema, parser, diagnostics, and fixtures.\n- Local `openclaw claws inspect` for validation and summary.\n- Local feed support for `claw` entries plus `openclaw claws feed inspect`.\n- Artifact/provenance preview for package-like entries using existing selector parsers.\n- Local and feed `apply --dry-run --json` lifecycle plans.\n- Real CLI E2E coverage for inspect, feed inspect, dry-run apply, feed dry-run apply, and fail-closed non-dry-run apply.\n\nThis PR intentionally does **not** add mutating apply, artifact installation, workspace writes, automation enablement, provenance persistence, ClawHub publishing/search, or Gateway state changes.\n\n## Command surface\n\nThe RFC now folds planning into dry-run apply. This PR matches that surface:\n\n```text\nopenclaw claws inspect <claw>\nopenclaw claws apply <claw> --dry-run --json\nopenclaw claws feed inspect <feed>\nopenclaw claws feed apply <feed> <claw> --dry-run --json\n```\n\nThere is no public `openclaw claws plan` or `openclaw claws feed plan` command in this PR. The internal resolver still builds the dry-run apply plan from the shared Claw resolution model.\n\n## RFC\n\nTracks RFC PR: https://github.com/openclaw/rfcs/pull/27\n\nCurrent RFC head at the time this PR body was refreshed: `1d5b93228fe37b86c57b298d8e990b06e8e290a0`, which folds public planning into `apply --dry-run --json`.\n\n## Validation\n\nCurrent branch head: `4b331214496f4ec831fe3f4f91a271163da2ac11`\n\n```text\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/claws/schema.test.ts src/claws/feed.test.ts src/cli/claws-cli.test.ts src/claws/lifecycle.e2e.test.ts src/cli/program/command-registry.test.ts src/cli/program/root-command-descriptions.test.ts\n# passed 3 Vitest shards\n\n$ git diff --check\n# no output\n\n$ node scripts/check-no-conflict-markers.mjs\n# no output\n\n$ rg -n \"claws plan|claws feed plan|command\\(\\\"plan\\\"\\)|runClawsPlanCommand|runClawsFeedPlanCommand|ClawsPlanOptions|ClawsFeedPlanOptions|feed plan|local plan\" src/claws src/cli\n# no output\n```\n\nNote: the normal commit hook could not run in this linked WSL worktree because `node_modules/.bin/oxfmt` is absent. The same source checks above were run explicitly.\r\n",
        "branch": "user/giodl/claws-pr2-schema-plan",
